; MARK: 11-3: 💬 口頭弁論
; ==============================================================================
; ＠ト書き▼議論11-3口頭弁論
; 議論開始カットイン
; BGM継続：yUki
@SetCustomVariable Expression:Judge11_3_3flag=false
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_48_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

# Judge11-3-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.9
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:さきほどあなたたちは、<br>【私の裁定には<br>正当性があるのか】<br>……と尋ねられましたね。|#0206Trial03_Yuki001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.3
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:それについても<br>説明してあげましょうか。|#0206Trial03_Yuki002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.7
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:実は私たち魔女は、<br>無惨にも人間に<br>この世から<br>駆逐されてしまったんです。|#0206Trial03_Yuki003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"<link=\"Objection_02_06_03_01\">一方的</link>な惨殺です。<br>平和主義の私たちは、<br>ほとんど反撃らしい反撃も<br>しませんでした……。|#0206Trial03_Yuki004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.15
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:その結果、<br>人間のせいで私たち魔女は<br>この世界から<br>いなくなってしまいました。|#0206Trial03_Yuki005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.6
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"……ならば、<br>逆に私が人間を<br><link=\"Objection_02_06_03_02\">滅ぼし返した</link>ところで<br>何の問題があるのでしょう？|#0206Trial03_Yuki006|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.14
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:これは正当性のある<br>復讐であると同時に……。|#0206Trial03_Yuki007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.6
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:魔女と人間が、<br>平等に同じ権利を<br>有するということ<br>でもあります。|#0206Trial03_Yuki008| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.10
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"――【他者を<link=\"Objection_02_06_03_03\">絶滅</link>させる】<br>という<link=\"Objection_02_06_03_04\">権利</link>を。|#0206Trial03_Yuki009|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

; IF 11-3-3通過で解放
@BeginIf Expression:Judge11_3_3flag=false
    @GotoModified Path:.Judge11-3-1Skip

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:魔女因子とは、<br>元々私そのもの……。<br>私は世界中のどこにいても、<br>魔女因子を<br>操ることができます。|#0206Trial03_Yuki010| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.6
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"ですから魔女因子を暴走させ<br>人間たちを空想上の化け物、<br>【<link=\"Objection_02_06_03_05\">魔女</link>】へ変化させて<br>殺すのです。|#0206Trial03_Yuki011|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

; ENDIF ここまで
# Judge11-3-1Skip

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.3
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:それにしても<br>【平等な権利】……<br>とても良い言葉ですね。|#0206Trial03_Yuki012| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.8
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:恣意的に<br>運用することが可能で……<br>人間の本質を表す、<br>粗雑な言葉です。|#0206Trial03_Yuki013| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4


