# Judge11-3-3

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-First
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:false
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Last

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Arms3,Eyes1_Normal_Closed1,Mouth1_Angry_Closed1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:【人間の絶滅】……。|#0206Trial03_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Arms3,Eyes1_Angry_Open1,Mouth1_Angry_Closed1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:それはどうやって行うつもりなのかな。|#0206Trial03_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:方法はいろいろ考えられるが、<br>まさか１人ずつ殺すわけではないだろう。|#0206Trial03_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.9
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:ええ。<br>それではさすがに時間がかかりすぎてしまいますね。|#0206Trial03_Yuki014| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.3
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:なので私は、すでに世界に蔓延させているのです――<br>【魔女因子】を。|#0206Trial03_Yuki015| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; SE・気になる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_Common_1 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Arms3,Eyes1_Angry_Open1,Mouth1_Angry_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:………！|#0206Trial03_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:まるでそれは疫病のように――。|#0206Trial03_Yuki016| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.3
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:人間たちの中にはもう、<br>私が振りまいた魔女因子が浸透しきっています。|#0206Trial03_Yuki017| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.6
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:長い時間をかけて、ゆっくりと……<br>そして確実に、気付かれることのないように……。|#0206Trial03_Yuki018| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.6
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:私は人の世の各地へと溶け込んで、<br>魔女因子を振りまいてきました。|#0206Trial03_Yuki019| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.6
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:それは私から人へ……<br>そして人から人へ……<br>親から子へ……。|#0206Trial03_Yuki020| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.12
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:今では全人類、ほとんど全ての人に<br>必要な量が行き渡っています。|#0206Trial03_Yuki021| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.6
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:今なら、世界中の人間に潜む魔女因子を暴走させ<br>魔女化させることも可能です。|#0206Trial03_Yuki022| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.14
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:人間たちは何が起こったかもわからぬまま、<br>突然自らの肉体が異形へと変質する<br>悪夢に襲われることでしょうね。|#0206Trial03_Yuki023| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:かくして人類は、<br>かつて自分たちが妄想の中に作り上げた<br>醜悪なる存在――。|#0206Trial03_Yuki024| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:――不老不死の化け物、【魔女】へとなりはて<br>絶望するのです。|#0206Trial03_Yuki025| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.3
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:……とっても素敵な終末を、<br>みなさんにお届けしますね。|#0206Trial03_Yuki026| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Arms3,Eyes1_Normal_Closed1,Mouth1_Angry_Closed1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:（不老不死の化け物……か）|#0206Trial03_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

